As we are working our way toward understanding geometric modeling
(and later UI), we will continue to explore parts of struct Main. The
struct Main member is a storehouse of Blender objects, and most of the
file-block types encountered in the blend file layout are binary images of
the “DNA” structs stored in struct Main ’s linked-lists.
